OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after drone and drugs
OL,4,Afound near prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fdrone, suspected drugs and a knife were
OL,8,Fdiscovered by police during a patrol
OL,9,Fnear a prison in South Yorkshire.
OL,11,FAn officer spotted a black Volvo S60
OL,12,Fparked on a dirt track near HMP
OL,13,FLindholme at about 22:15 BST on Tuesday
OL,14,Fbefore it was driven off and failed to
OL,15,Fstop, with items being seen thrown from
OL,16,Fthe car during a pursuit, according to
OL,17,Fpolice.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
