OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after drone and drugs
OL,4,Afound near prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe items were later recovered and
OL,7,Ffound to include the drone and a
OL,8,Fcamouflaged parcel containing Class A
OL,9,Fand Class B drugs, tobacco,
OL,10,Fe-cigarettes and a knife.
OL,12,FThe car was eventually stopped and the
OL,13,Fmen were arrested and later bailed
OL,14,Fpending further inquiries, a South
OL,15,FYorkshire Police spokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
